<title>FRANCE: Paris bourse steady above 2,620.</title>
<headline>Paris bourse steady above 2,620.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>French shares firm in afternoon trade as investors give new government benefit of doubt as they await news of key appointments and policy decisions.</p>
<p>Bourse helped by firmer bond prices.</p>
<p>* CAC-40 index up 23.16, or 0.89 percent, at 2,624.61 at 1240 GMT</p>
<p>* CAC-40 June futures 2,606 vs 2,571 at Monday's close.</p>
<p>* Broader SBF120 index up 17.77 at 1,812.11</p>
<p>* Financial, privatisation stocks recover much of Monday's fall.</p>
</text>
